				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;9. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;GPPL is a party to an arbitration proceeding with a construction contractor relating to certain matters arising under the parties&amp;#x2019; construction agreement, including claims and counterclaims associated with project performance and related costs. The arbitration was initiated in March 2026 and is in its early stages.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
