    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH8D8B5E3CF3B64508E044122AA1F515FB" xlink:label="HH8D8B5E3CF3B64508E044122AA1F515FB" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHD4945882D52945B495027428FD80A62F" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
Effective July 1, 2019, GPPL began amortizing the Regulatory Asset, created in accordance with the Commission's Order per Docket No. CP11-34, pursuant to the Order Approving Settlement issued June 14, 2019 under Docket No. RP19-1219-000. The Regulatory Asset will be amortized over a 50-year period commencing July 1, 2019.</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH8D8B5E3CF3B64508E044122AA1F515FB" xlink:to="HHD4945882D52945B495027428FD80A62F" order="1" />
